<> Since this module is included with every BFB program, this also means that
<> every BFB module can use these functions and variables

<> Declarations (all modules)
r0 = 0
r1 = 0
r2 = 0

<> Reusable variables (all modules)

<> Find the minimum out of two numbers
def min {
    if r1 < r0 {
        ret r1
    }

    if r0 <= r1 {
        ret r0
    }
}

<> Find the maximum out of two numbers
def max {
    if r1 > r0 {
        ret r1
    }

    if r0 >= r1 {
        ret r0
    }
}
